      "content": "hey, im having a really bad allergy flare up today. i woke up with these huge itchy hives all over my arms and i keep sneezing. my throat feels kinda tight too like its hard to swallow but i think it just has anything to do with the hay fever being so bad right now. should i just take a double dose of my cetirizine to make it stop or do i need to see someone?",
